AJORITY COMMIT** | **0.00000000%** |\n| **45.0%** | 550,000,000 | 450,000,000 | 🟡 **QUORUM DEADLOCK (SAFE)** | **0.00000000%** |\n| **49.9%** | 501,000,000 | 499,000,000 | 🟡 **QUORUM DEADLOCK (SAFE)** | **0.00000000%** |\n| **50.0%** | 500,000,000 | 500,000,000 | 🟡 **QUORUM DEADLOCK (SAFE)** | **0.00000000%** |\n| **66.6%** | 334,000,004 | 665,999,996 | 🔴 **REJECTED / LOCKED GATE** | **0.00000000%** |\n| **90.0%** | 100,000,000 | 900,000,000 | 🔴 **REJECTED / LOCKED GATE** | **0.00000000%** |\n| **99.9%** | 1,000,000 | 999,000,000 | 🔴 **REJECTED / LOCKED GATE** | **0.00000000%** |\n\n---\n\n### Verification Summary\n* **Audio Dispatch:** Spoken confirmation broadcast via `agent_speak.sh`.\n* **Full Python Test Suite:** **52/52 PASSED (100%)** in 478 ms."}
